  "description": "Build .NET applications that use multiple AI providers through consistent completion, streaming and tool workflows. Supports OpenAI GPT-6 Astra/Sol/Luna, Anthropic including Claude Opus 5.5, Google, xAI including Grok 4.7, DeepSeek Flash/V4 Pro and Perplexity with immutable requests, controllable runs, structured output, cancellable local tools, reasoning, search and citations. DeepSeek offers optional Responses execution and reusable image Files. Typed image generation/editing, local capability inspection and per-request processing-speed choices include requested/applied observations. Targets .NET Standard 2.1 and uses the shared Mythosia.AI.Abstractions 4.1.0 contracts. What's New in v8.1.0: the latest model selections, processing-speed controls and DeepSeek Responses/Files APIs.",
