  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v8.1.0 adds GPT-6 Sol/Luna, Claude Opus 5.5, Grok 4.7 and DeepSeek V4 Pro, optional DeepSeek Responses execution and reusable image Files, plus per-request processing speed and requested/applied observations. Existing service defaults and public APIs remain. Aligns Google image-option validation with model capabilities, preserves RAG tool continuations and isolates stored summaries from stateless requests. Requires Mythosia.AI.Abstractions 4.1.0. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/core/Mythosia.AI/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v810",
